$*
$* EXECUTIVE CONTROL
$*
$*$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
$*
SOL 200
$ INCLUDE 'attune30.dmap' goes here (left out: the DMAP is not in this folder)
CEND
$*
$*$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
$*
$* CASE CONTROL
$*
$*$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
$*
